Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.34,0:00:02.42,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}I'm a little upset.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N我有点郁闷
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.42,0:00:03.62,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}I have two of these now.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这种奖杯 我已有两座
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.76,0:00:05.88,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}I wanted the bigger one, but that's okay.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N我想要更大的 不过没关系
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.14,0:00:07.44,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}It's still a pretty trophy.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这个奖杯也很漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.71,0:00:11.20,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2024{\fs68}年 她也拿过辛辛那提亚军
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.20,0:00:13.53,TL,,0,0,0,,今年两座冠军 {\fs78}3{\fs68}次亚军
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.53,0:00:16.49,TL,,0,0,0,,佩古拉也经历过法网首轮出局
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.49,0:00:20.04,TL,,0,0,0,,她的这张年终门票 要从一月说起
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.51,0:00:24.00,TL,,0,0,0,,布里斯班打进{\fs78}4{\fs68}强 澳网也进{\fs78}4{\fs68}强
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.00,0:00:27.05,TL,,0,0,0,,墨尔本 她连胜凯斯和阿尼西莫娃
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.05,0:00:29.89,TL,,0,0,0,,半决赛两盘负于莱巴金娜
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.84,0:00:39.76,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Makes no mistake of it this time,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这一次她没有再失手
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.44,0:00:42.72,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}and it's Elena Rybakina{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N莱巴金娜
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.72,0:00:47.56,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}moving into the Australian Open final of 2026.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N闯进{\fs78}2026{\fs68}年澳网决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.86,0:00:49.41,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2{\fs68}月来到迪拜
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.41,0:00:51.12,TL,,0,0,0,,半决赛先丢一盘
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.12,0:00:54.07,TL,,0,0,0,,她连追两盘击败阿尼西莫娃
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.07,0:00:57.42,TL,,0,0,0,,决赛{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}2{\fs68} {\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}4{\fs68}战胜斯维托丽娜
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.42,0:00:59.55,TL,,0,0,0,,拿到本赛季第一冠
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.39,0:01:05.91,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}It is a dream debut Dubai title{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N梦幻般的迪拜首冠
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.91,0:01:07.57,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}for Jessica Pegula,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N属于杰西卡 佩古拉
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.57,0:01:11.63,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}and she seals it in style with an ace.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N她用一记{\fs78}ACE{\fs68}漂亮收官
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.10,0:01:13.36,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}But just super happy{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N但我特别开心
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.36,0:01:14.91,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}to go home with a trophy.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N能带着奖杯回家
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.96,0:01:17.44,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}It was just, it was a great week.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这一周真的很棒
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.76,0:01:19.77,TL,,0,0,0,,印第安维尔斯 迈阿密
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.77,0:01:22.98,TL,,0,0,0,,她都打进{\fs78}8{\fs68}强 也都输给莱巴金娜
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.98,0:01:24.09,TL,,0,0,0,,算上澳网
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.09,0:01:27.07,TL,,0,0,0,,这是她今年第三次输给这个对手
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.63,0:01:35.49,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}It's another service winner from Rybakina.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N莱巴金娜又打出一记发球制胜
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.67,0:01:36.91,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}It doesn't come back.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这一球没能回过来
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.91,0:01:40.67,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And it's another defeat for Pegula against their old rival.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N面对这位老对手 佩古拉再次落败
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.12,0:01:42.27,TL,,0,0,0,,到了查尔斯顿
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.27,0:01:45.27,TL,,0,0,0,,她连打{\fs78}4{\fs68}场{\fs78}3{\fs68}盘 撑进决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.27,0:01:46.42,TL,,0,0,0,,决赛{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}2{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.42,0:01:48.96,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}2{\fs68}击败斯塔罗杜布采娃
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.96,0:01:51.15,TL,,0,0,0,,拿到本赛季第二冠
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.89,0:01:53.07,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}So good.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.27,0:01:55.85,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}She saved the match points.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N对手此前救下那些冠军点
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.31,0:01:59.02,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And now a fourth championship point.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N现在来到第四个冠军点
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.47,0:02:03.42,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}What a week!{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N多么精彩的一周
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.87,0:02:08.77,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}The defending champion claims the title again in Charleston.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N卫冕冠军再度称霸查尔斯顿
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.15,0:02:13.71,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And no one has won more matches this year{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N论本赛季{\fs78}WTA{\fs68}胜场数
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.71,0:02:17.05,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}on the WTA Tour than Jess Pegula.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N还无人超过佩古拉
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.32,0:02:20.89,TL,,0,0,0,,马德里第三轮出局 罗马止步{\fs78}8{\fs68}强
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.89,0:02:23.85,TL,,0,0,0,,到了法网 先以{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}1{\fs68}拿下首盘
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.85,0:02:27.35,TL,,0,0,0,,她却被比勒尔连追两盘 首轮出局
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.72,0:02:28.67,TL,,0,0,0,,草地赛季
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.67,0:02:30.93,TL,,0,0,0,,她在柏林半决赛的决胜盘送
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.93,0:02:33.14,TL,,0,0,0,,给萨巴伦卡一个{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}0{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.14,0:02:36.41,TL,,0,0,0,,决赛负于诺斯科娃 取得亚军
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.45,0:02:50.57,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Jessica Pegula, the 2024 winner in Berlin, is into another final,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N{\fs78}2024{\fs68}年冠军佩古拉再进决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.87,0:02:56.79,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}as she takes out the world number one, Aryna Sabalenka.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N她击败了世界第一萨巴伦卡
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.12,0:02:59.66,TL,,0,0,0,,温网止步{\fs78}8{\fs68}强 她先赢一盘
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.66,0:03:01.37,TL,,0,0,0,,仍被高芙逆转
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.37,0:03:04.13,TL,,0,0,0,,华盛顿 今年第四次进入决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.13,0:03:07.58,TL,,0,0,0,,最终又在先赢一盘后负于伊埃拉
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.37,0:03:23.43,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}It's Eala's magical moment.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这是伊埃拉的神奇时刻
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.75,0:03:27.57,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}The moment she has dreamt of.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N她梦寐以求的这一刻
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.81,0:03:33.39,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}A first ever tour title delivered in DC.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N首座巡回赛冠军 在华盛顿
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.70,0:03:35.60,TL,,0,0,0,,多伦多第四轮出局之后
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.60,0:03:38.63,TL,,0,0,0,,她在辛辛那提连续赢下{\fs78}3{\fs68}场{\fs78}3{\fs68}盘
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.63,0:03:40.10,TL,,0,0,0,,依次过了科斯蒂亚
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.10,0:03:42.42,TL,,0,0,0,,阿尼西莫娃和斯瓦泰克
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.42,0:03:45.99,TL,,0,0,0,,赛季第五次决赛 她又负于高芙
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.61,0:03:53.59,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}She needs the first only.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N她只用一个赛点就兑现
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.65,0:03:57.05,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Jessica Pegula, for the second time in her career,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N佩古拉职业生涯第二次
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.05,0:03:59.41,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}will feature in the final here in Cincy.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N打进辛辛那提决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.63,0:04:12.95,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}It is the first title of the year for Coco Gauff.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这是高芙今年的首冠
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.55,0:04:15.65,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}It is her second in Cincinnati,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N她第二次在辛辛那提夺冠
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.47,0:04:21.13,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}and it is the 12th singles title of her tremendous career.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N也是她生涯第十二座单打冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.48,0:04:26.30,TL,,0,0,0,,美网 她逆转费尔南德斯和纳瓦罗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.30,0:04:28.97,TL,,0,0,0,,今年第二次拿到大满贯{\fs78}4{\fs68}强
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.97,0:04:30.35,TL,,0,0,0,,赢下纳瓦罗后
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.35,0:04:33.05,TL,,0,0,0,,她谈到那些消极的念头
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.29,0:04:49.91,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}She got through it.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N她挺过来了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.71,0:05:00.33,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}She's in the semis at her favorite tournament.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N她在最爱的赛事打进四强
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.67,0:05:03.57,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}I think I do a great job of having a short-term memory,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N我很擅长不纠结刚发生的事
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.57,0:05:06.05,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}so I know that every time I come out, no matter what,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N所以每次上场 无论如何
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.15,0:05:09.51,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}I just have to tell all the negative me{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N我得对那个消极的自己说
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.51,0:05:11.09,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}to shut up and just play tennis{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N闭嘴 继续打网球
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.09,0:05:12.63,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}and compete and battle{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N去竞争 去战斗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.63,0:05:15.21,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}and think out there and try and problem-solve as best I can.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N动脑筋 尽全力解决问题
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.37,0:05:17.93,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And yeah, that's all I'm trying to do, really.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N对 我努力做的就是这些
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.00,0:05:21.92,TL,,0,0,0,,半决赛 {\fs78}5{\fs68}比{\fs78}7{\fs68} {\fs78}2{\fs68}比{\fs78}6{\fs68}负于萨巴伦卡
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.92,0:05:24.26,TL,,0,0,0,,今年大满贯最好成绩是{\fs78}4{\fs68}强
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.26,0:05:26.66,TL,,0,0,0,,分别在澳网和美网
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.17,0:05:36.51,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Oh, what a save!{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N哦 救得真漂亮！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.48,0:05:40.54,TL,,0,0,0,,美网之后 她退出新加坡和北京
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.54,0:05:43.07,TL,,0,0,0,,回到武汉 首战先赢一盘
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.07,0:05:45.56,TL,,0,0,0,,第二盘抢七还拿到{\fs78}3{\fs68}个赛点
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.56,0:05:48.33,TL,,0,0,0,,最终却被奥斯塔彭科逆转
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.46,0:06:05.49,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}That is unreal.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N太不可思议了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.97,0:06:16.75,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Ostapenko packs a power punch in Wuhan.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N奥斯塔彭科在武汉打出重拳
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.75,0:06:21.71,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}A dazzling attacking performance from one of the biggest hitters in the game,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N网坛重炮手 打出耀眼进攻
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.71,0:06:24.35,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}as she picks Pegula apart.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N拆解了佩古拉的防线
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.57,0:06:27.15,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}The second seed is stunned.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N二号种子爆冷出局
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.69,0:06:30.17,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}She missed three match points in the second set,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N她在第二盘错失了三个赛点
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.17,0:06:32.71,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}and they proved so costly.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这让她付出了沉重代价
